s, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YUDcLokFMZOtyWAmVY3jwA","review_id":"Qo4VrslxNlNOVMH051QJ-g","date":"2019-07-10T19:59:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9443752765655518,"text_excerpt":"Had a nice time at Landry's in the French quarter. We had a special guest in town from New York so we picked the fq location. Although we waited a long time for appetizers, we enjoyed the food and environment. The server Will was super friendly and attentive and always had our drinks refilled. The host Bill was also very polite. I ate crab cakes for dinner with cheese grits which were amazing. I tried the crab and fondue dip, calamari, crawfish bread, and crab fritters. Everything was delicious. Thank you for a great night out."},{"business_id":"YUDcLokFMZOtyWAmVY3jwA","review_id":"oIXhLSkb5XcxbRCEPjlbDw","date":"2019-03-10T17:40:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9345663785934448,"text_excerpt":"I had family visiting and we were hungry and this was the first place we saw. I'm really glad we stopped in because I was pleasantly surprised at how fresh and tasty everything was. We got the bbq oysters, shrimp remoulade lettuce wraps, fried calamari and pimiento cheese grits. The oysters were so delicious and melted into the breadcrumbs and butter perfectly. The shrimp remoulade was perfect. The pimiento cheese grits were some of the best I've had. The only dish I can't speak to is the fried calamari because I didn't try it, but my guests finished it and loved it. So I was really impressed with the fact that every dish we tried, we loved. The service is also fantastic. I'm sure my mom ..."},{"business_id":"YUDcLokFMZOtyWAmVY3jwA","review_id":"Y9r5hAmTbDTekyTRjsZuMw","date":"2018-04-15T14:34:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9235191345214844,"text_excerpt":"We try to eat somewhere special on our last night of a trip. This was our first visit to New Orleans. We started by looking for a Landry's restaurant since we are club members. When this place popped up we made reservations. We were seated at a table in the bar area. We requested a low top instead of a high top table on the reservation. Don't make this mistake. The high top tables are the ones beside the window that overlooks the river. Our server's name was Erica and she was an absolute delight. She made our dining experience very enjoyable. I started with the Captain's punch which contained rum, banana, peach, and tropical juices. It was very good. The blackened redfish etouffee with cr..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YUDcLokFMZOtyWAmVY3jwA","photo_id":"-ylaRAL0JoYCv3lBaBV17Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-ylaRAL0JoYCv3lBaBV17Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8939263224601746},{"business_id":"YUDcLokFMZOtyWAmVY3jwA","photo_id":"MN6i3X1ESEOiqvodDwDeEQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MN6i3X1ESEOiqvodDwDeEQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8564198017120361},{"business_id":"YUDcLokFMZOtyWAmVY3jwA","photo_id":"P3fcFCFvHH2PLc2ulIK7cQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/P3fcFCFvHH2PLc2ulIK7cQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7971541285514832},{"business_id":"YUDcLokFMZOtyWAmVY3jwA","photo_id":"mZPSRA5K4_NZBYDdOOi7Xg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mZPSRA5K4_NZBYDdOOi7Xg.jpg","visual_represe